#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: checkoff.php
msgid "CheckOff"
msgstr "CheckOff"

#. Description of the plugin
#: checkoff.php
msgid "Let visitors build their own multi-level checklists from building blocks — simple lists, lists with due dates or \"not needed\", weekday lists, ratings, measurements, choices, switches, counters and notes — and tick them off."
msgstr "Besucher stellen eigene, mehrstufige Checklisten aus Bausteinen zusammen – einfache Listen, Listen mit Fälligkeit oder „Entfällt“, Wochentagslisten, Bewertungen, Messwerte, Auswahlen, Umschalter, Zähler und Notizen – und haken sie ab."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:112
msgid "General"
msgstr "Allgemein"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:113
msgid "Where checklists are shown and who may create them."
msgstr "Wo Checklisten angezeigt werden und wer sie anlegen darf."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:117
msgid "Checklist page"
msgstr "Checklisten-Seite"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:118
msgid "The page that contains the [cko_app] or [cko_checklist] shortcode. Links to checklists — in the REST API, the mails, the share menu — and the \"Open\" form lead there. Without a choice, the first published page with one of these shortcodes (also in Elementor) is used."
msgstr "Die Seite mit dem Shortcode [cko_app] oder [cko_checklist]. Links zu Checklisten – in der REST-API, den E-Mails, dem Teilen-Menü – und das Formular „Öffnen“ führen dorthin. Ohne Auswahl wird die erste veröffentlichte Seite mit einem dieser Shortcodes verwendet (auch in Elementor)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:125
msgid "Guests may create checklists"
msgstr "Gäste dürfen Checklisten anlegen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:126
msgid "Off: only logged-in users can create checklists. Opening and ticking existing checklists by their ID is always possible."
msgstr "Aus: Nur angemeldete Benutzer können Checklisten anlegen. Bestehende Checklisten per ID öffnen und abhaken ist immer möglich."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:133
msgid "Live update"
msgstr "Live-Abgleich"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:134
msgid "Seconds between two checks for changes made on other devices while a checklist is open. 0 = off (changes appear after reloading)."
msgstr "Sekunden zwischen zwei Abfragen nach Änderungen auf anderen Geräten, solange eine Checkliste offen ist. 0 = aus (Änderungen erscheinen nach dem Neuladen)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:143
msgid "REST API"
msgstr "REST-API"

#. translators: %s: REST namespace.
#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:146
#, php-format
msgid "Everything the website can do with checklists, also under %s. Access to a checklist works as on the website, by its ID, with the same quotas. \"Logged-in users only\" requires a WordPress login, e.g. an application password."
msgstr "Alles, was die Website mit Checklisten kann, auch unter %s. Der Zugang zu einer Checkliste funktioniert wie auf der Website über ihre ID, mit denselben Kontingenten. „Nur angemeldete Benutzer“ verlangt eine WordPress-Anmeldung, z. B. ein Anwendungspasswort."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:151
msgid "Everybody (like the website)"
msgstr "Alle (wie die Website)"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:152
msgid "Logged-in users only"
msgstr "Nur angemeldete Benutzer"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:153
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Aus"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:160 includes/lib/class-checkoff-shortcodes.php:485
msgid "Public checklists"
msgstr "Öffentliche Checklisten"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:161
msgid "Owners of protected checklists may show them publicly: they appear in the directory [cko_lists], where everybody can open, view and tick them; changing them still needs the password. Nothing is approved beforehand — you can take a list out in its IDs box. Off: the directory is empty; the lists keep their choice and come back when it is switched on again."
msgstr "Wer eine geschützte Checkliste besitzt, darf sie öffentlich zeigen: Sie erscheint im Verzeichnis [cko_lists], wo alle sie öffnen, ansehen und abhaken können; ändern geht weiterhin nur mit Passwort. Vorher wird nichts freigegeben – du kannst eine Liste in ihrem ID-Kasten herausnehmen. Aus: Das Verzeichnis ist leer; die Listen behalten ihre Wahl und erscheinen wieder, sobald es eingeschaltet wird."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:168
msgid "History of rounds"
msgstr "Verlauf der Durchgänge"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:169
msgid "Keep the ticks and values of the closed rounds of repeating checklists, visible only with the ID that edits. Off: only the round before the current one is kept, for \"last time\". Switching it off deletes every kept round."
msgstr "Häkchen und Werte abgeschlossener Durchgänge wiederkehrender Checklisten aufbewahren, sichtbar nur für die ID, die bearbeiten darf. Aus: Nur der Durchgang vor dem laufenden bleibt, für „letztes Mal“. Ausschalten löscht alle aufbewahrten Durchgänge."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:176
msgid "Keep rounds for"
msgstr "Durchgänge aufbewahren"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:177
msgid "days after a round ended; older rounds are deleted automatically."
msgstr "Tage nach Ende eines Durchgangs; ältere werden automatisch gelöscht."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:186
msgid "Tick ahead"
msgstr "Vorab abhaken"

#. translators: %s: maximum.
#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:189
#, php-format
msgid "rounds of a repeating checklist that can be paged to and ticked in advance (up to %s) — e.g. \"not needed\" for next week's holiday. 0: only the round in force."
msgstr "Durchgänge einer wiederkehrenden Checkliste, zu denen man vorblättern und die man vorab abhaken kann (bis %s) – z. B. „Entfällt“ für den Urlaub nächste Woche. 0: nur der laufende Durchgang."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:200
msgid "Length of new IDs"
msgstr "Länge neuer IDs"

#. translators: 1: minimum, 2: maximum.
#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:203
#, php-format
msgid "Characters, %1$s to %2$s. Longer IDs are harder to guess and harder to type. Existing IDs keep their length."
msgstr "Zeichen, %1$s bis %2$s. Längere IDs sind schwerer zu erraten und schwerer abzutippen. Bestehende IDs behalten ihre Länge."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:217
msgid "Building blocks"
msgstr "Bausteine"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:218
msgid "Which building blocks visitors can use, and how the ratings look. A block that is switched off is no longer offered; checklists already using it keep working."
msgstr "Welche Bausteine Besucher verwenden können und wie die Bewertungen aussehen. Ein abgeschalteter Baustein wird nicht mehr angeboten; Checklisten, die ihn schon verwenden, funktionieren weiter."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:223
msgid "Design"
msgstr "Design"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:224
msgid "Colours, corners, size and font of the checklists on the website. Empty fields keep CheckOff's own look; a theme can still override everything through CheckOff's CSS variables."
msgstr "Farben, Ecken, Größe und Schrift der Checklisten auf der Website. Leere Felder behalten das Aussehen von CheckOff; ein Theme kann weiterhin alles über die CSS-Variablen von CheckOff überschreiben."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:230
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Grenzen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:231
msgid "Protect the site against oversized checklists and misuse."
msgstr "Schützt die Website vor übergroßen Checklisten und Missbrauch."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:235
msgid "Nesting depth"
msgstr "Verschachtelungstiefe"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:236
msgid "How many levels a checklist may have, the top level included."
msgstr "Wie viele Ebenen eine Checkliste haben darf, die oberste mitgezählt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:245
msgid "Maximum size"
msgstr "Maximale Größe"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:246
msgid "How many entries and sub-lists one checklist may contain in total."
msgstr "Wie viele Einträge und Unterlisten eine Checkliste insgesamt enthalten darf."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:255
msgid "New checklists per hour"
msgstr "Neue Checklisten pro Stunde"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:256
msgid "Per visitor. 0 = unlimited."
msgstr "Pro Besucher. 0 = unbegrenzt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:265
msgid "New checklists per hour, all visitors"
msgstr "Neue Checklisten pro Stunde, alle Besucher"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:266
msgid "All visitors together — stops a flood from many addresses, which no per-visitor quota can. 0 = unlimited."
msgstr "Alle Besucher zusammen – stoppt eine Flut von vielen Adressen, die kein Kontingent pro Besucher aufhalten kann. 0 = unbegrenzt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:275
msgid "Ticks per hour"
msgstr "Abhaken pro Stunde"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:276
msgid "Per visitor: values written — ticks, ratings, counts, notes (a typed note is saved after each pause). Applies to the website and the REST API. 0 = unlimited."
msgstr "Pro Besucher: geschriebene Werte – Haken, Bewertungen, Zählerstände, Notizen (eine Notiz wird nach jeder Tipp-Pause gespeichert). Gilt für Website und REST-API. 0 = unbegrenzt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:285
msgid "Changes per hour"
msgstr "Änderungen pro Stunde"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:286
msgid "Per visitor: saves of a checklist's structure (while editing, after each pause in typing), clearing all ticks, deleting. Applies to the website and the REST API. 0 = unlimited."
msgstr "Pro Besucher: Speichern des Aufbaus einer Checkliste (beim Bearbeiten nach jeder Tipp-Pause), Zurücksetzen aller Haken, Löschen. Gilt für Website und REST-API. 0 = unbegrenzt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:295
msgid "Subscription requests per hour"
msgstr "Abo-Anfragen pro Stunde"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:296
msgid "Per visitor. Every request sends a confirmation e-mail. 0 = unlimited (not recommended)."
msgstr "Pro Besucher. Jede Anfrage verschickt eine Bestätigungs-E-Mail. 0 = unbegrenzt (nicht empfohlen)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:305
msgid "Unknown IDs per hour"
msgstr "Unbekannte IDs pro Stunde"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:306
msgid "Per visitor. After this many attempts with IDs that do not exist, opening checklists is blocked for an hour, so IDs cannot be guessed by trying. 0 = unlimited (not recommended)."
msgstr "Pro Besucher. Nach so vielen Versuchen mit IDs, die es nicht gibt, ist das Öffnen von Checklisten für eine Stunde gesperrt – so lassen sich IDs nicht durch Ausprobieren erraten. 0 = unbegrenzt (nicht empfohlen)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:315
msgid "Wrong passwords per hour"
msgstr "Falsche Passwörter pro Stunde"

#. translators: %s: number of wrong passwords per checklist and hour.
#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:317
#, php-format
msgid "Per visitor, for password-protected checklists. After this many wrong passwords, unlocking is refused for an hour, the right password included; the same happens after %s wrong passwords for one checklist from all visitors together. 0 = unlimited (not recommended)."
msgstr "Pro Besucher, für passwortgeschützte Checklisten. Nach so vielen falschen Passwörtern wird das Entsperren eine Stunde lang abgelehnt, auch mit dem richtigen Passwort; ebenso nach %s falschen Passwörtern für eine Checkliste von allen Besuchern zusammen. 0 = unbegrenzt (nicht empfohlen)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:326
msgid "Visitor address from"
msgstr "Besucher-Adresse aus"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:327
msgid "How visitors are told apart for the quotas. Keep \"Connection\" unless the site is behind a proxy or CDN such as Cloudflare — there every visitor would otherwise share one quota. Choose a header only if the proxy sets it: otherwise visitors can write it themselves and escape every quota. IPv6 addresses count per /64 network. The address is never stored, only a salted hash for one hour."
msgstr "Woran Besucher für die Kontingente unterschieden werden. Lass „Verbindung“ stehen, außer die Website liegt hinter einem Proxy oder CDN wie Cloudflare – dort würden sich sonst alle Besucher ein Kontingent teilen. Wähle einen Header nur, wenn der Proxy ihn setzt: Sonst können Besucher ihn selbst schreiben und jedem Kontingent entgehen. IPv6-Adressen zählen pro /64-Netz. Die Adresse wird nie gespeichert, nur ein gesalzener Hash für eine Stunde."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:330
msgid "Connection (REMOTE_ADDR)"
msgstr "Verbindung (REMOTE_ADDR)"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:342 includes/lib/class-checkoff-subscriptions.php:1739
msgid "E-mail"
msgstr "E-Mail"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:343
msgid "Subscriptions by e-mail and the mails CheckOff sends. Subscribers confirm their address first (double opt-in); only the address, the checklist and the time of confirmation are stored."
msgstr "Abos per E-Mail und die E-Mails, die CheckOff verschickt. Abonnenten bestätigen ihre Adresse zuerst (Double-Opt-in); gespeichert werden nur die Adresse, die Checkliste und der Zeitpunkt der Bestätigung."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:348
msgid "Maintenance"
msgstr "Wartung"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:349
msgid "Cleanup and uninstall."
msgstr "Aufräumen und Deinstallation."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:353
msgid "Delete unused checklists"
msgstr "Unbenutzte Checklisten löschen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:354
msgid "Days without being opened after which a checklist is deleted automatically (checked once a day). 0 = never."
msgstr "Tage ohne Aufruf, nach denen eine Checkliste automatisch gelöscht wird (einmal täglich geprüft). 0 = nie."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:363
msgid "Delete checklists on uninstall"
msgstr "Checklisten bei Deinstallation löschen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:364
msgid "When the plugin is deleted, also delete all checklists. Settings are always removed."
msgstr "Beim Löschen des Plugins auch alle Checklisten löschen. Die Einstellungen werden immer entfernt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:390 includes/lib/class-checkoff-subscriptions.php:340
msgid "Subscriptions"
msgstr "Abos"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:394
msgid "Allow subscriptions"
msgstr "Abos erlauben"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:395
msgid "Visitors can subscribe to a checklist with their e-mail address. Set up the sender and the footer (imprint) below first."
msgstr "Besucher können eine Checkliste mit ihrer E-Mail-Adresse abonnieren. Richte vorher unten Absender und Fußzeile (Impressum) ein."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:402
msgid "Consent text"
msgstr "Einwilligungstext"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:403
msgid "Shown beside the checkbox visitors tick to subscribe. Links are allowed. Empty: a standard sentence with a link to the privacy policy page."
msgstr "Steht neben dem Kästchen, das Besucher zum Abonnieren ankreuzen. Links sind erlaubt. Leer: ein Standardsatz mit Link zur Datenschutzerklärung."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:410
msgid "Subscriptions per checklist"
msgstr "Abos pro Checkliste"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:411
msgid "At most this many addresses can subscribe to one checklist."
msgstr "Höchstens so viele Adressen können eine Checkliste abonnieren."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:420
msgid "Delete unconfirmed after"
msgstr "Unbestätigte löschen nach"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:421
msgid "Hours. A subscription that is not confirmed by then is deleted together with its address."
msgstr "Stunden. Ein bis dahin nicht bestätigtes Abo wird samt Adresse gelöscht."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:431
msgid "Sender"
msgstr "Absender"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:435
msgid "Sender name"
msgstr "Absendername"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:436
msgid "Empty: the site title."
msgstr "Leer: der Titel der Website."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:444
msgid "Sender address"
msgstr "Absenderadresse"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:445
msgid "Empty: the administration e-mail address. Use an address of this domain, or mails may end up as spam."
msgstr "Leer: die Administrator-E-Mail-Adresse. Verwende eine Adresse dieser Domain, sonst landen Mails womöglich im Spam."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:453
msgid "Footer"
msgstr "Fußzeile"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:454
msgid "Under every mail, e.g. the imprint (who sends this mail and how to reach them). Links are allowed. Placeholder in templates: {{ footer_html }}."
msgstr "Unter jeder Mail, z. B. das Impressum (wer die Mail verschickt und wie man ihn erreicht). Links sind erlaubt. Platzhalter in Vorlagen: {{ footer_html }}."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:462
msgid "Mails"
msgstr "Mails"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:463
msgid "Which mails subscribers receive and when. Each row is one mail: a trigger, a time, a subject and a template. Subjects may contain placeholders such as {{ checklist }}."
msgstr "Welche Mails Abonnenten wann bekommen. Jede Zeile ist eine Mail: ein Auslöser, eine Uhrzeit, ein Betreff und eine Vorlage. Betreffzeilen dürfen Platzhalter wie {{ checklist }} enthalten."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:467
msgid "Subject of the confirmation mail"
msgstr "Betreff der Bestätigungsmail"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:468
msgid "The mail with the confirmation link (template confirm.html). Empty: the default subject."
msgstr "Die Mail mit dem Bestätigungslink (Vorlage confirm.html). Leer: der Standardbetreff."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:471 includes/lib/class-checkoff-subscriptions.php:183
msgid "Please confirm your subscription: {{ checklist }}"
msgstr "Bitte bestätige dein Abo: {{ checklist }}"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:476
msgid "Sending rules"
msgstr "Versandregeln"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:483 includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:967
msgid "Send log"
msgstr "Versandprotokoll"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:487
msgid "Keep a send log"
msgstr "Versandprotokoll führen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:488
msgid "Records time, masked recipient (e.g. jo***@ex***.de), subject and success of every mail — never the full address or the content. Off by default."
msgstr "Hält Zeit, maskierten Empfänger (z. B. jo***@ex***.de), Betreff und Erfolg jeder Mail fest – nie die vollständige Adresse oder den Inhalt. Standardmäßig aus."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:495
msgid "Keep log entries for"
msgstr "Protokolleinträge behalten für"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:496
msgid "Days."
msgstr "Tage."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:518
msgid "Available building blocks"
msgstr "Verfügbare Bausteine"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:530
msgid "Always available, as every checklist is built on it."
msgstr "Immer verfügbar, weil jede Checkliste darauf aufbaut."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:542
msgid "Colour scale"
msgstr "Farbskala"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:543
msgid "Five steps from lowest to highest. A scale with three colours uses the first, the middle and the last step."
msgstr "Fünf Stufen von der niedrigsten zur höchsten. Eine Skala mit drei Farben verwendet die erste, die mittlere und die letzte Stufe."

#. translators: %s: step number.
#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:554
#, php-format
msgid "Step %s"
msgstr "Stufe %s"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:569 includes/lib/blocks/class-checkoff-block-number-scale.php:36
msgid "Rating with numbers"
msgstr "Bewertung mit Zahlen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:574
msgid "Default from"
msgstr "Standard von"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:575
msgid "Lowest number of a new rating block. Visitors can change it per block."
msgstr "Niedrigste Zahl eines neuen Bewertungsbausteins. Besucher können sie je Baustein ändern."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:585
msgid "Default to"
msgstr "Standard bis"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:586
msgid "Highest number of a new rating block."
msgstr "Höchste Zahl eines neuen Bewertungsbausteins."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:649 includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:843
msgid "CheckOff Settings"
msgstr "CheckOff-Einstellungen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:650 includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:688 includes/class-checkoff.php:438
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:867
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen speichern"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:893
msgid "Everything on one page: the checklist when the address carries an ID, otherwise the forms to create and open one and the recently opened checklists."
msgstr "Alles auf einer Seite: die Checkliste, wenn die Adresse eine ID enthält, sonst die Formulare zum Anlegen und Öffnen und die zuletzt geöffneten Checklisten."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:894
msgid "The checklist whose ID is in the address (?cko=…)."
msgstr "Die Checkliste, deren ID in der Adresse steht (?cko=…)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:895
msgid "A fixed checklist, e.g. embedded by the theme."
msgstr "Eine feste Checkliste, z. B. vom Theme eingebunden."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:896
msgid "Form to create a checklist. Attributes: title, button."
msgstr "Formular zum Anlegen einer Checkliste. Attribute: title, button."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:897
msgid "Form to open a checklist by its ID. Attributes: title, button."
msgstr "Formular zum Öffnen einer Checkliste per ID. Attribute: title, button."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:898
msgid "The templates of this site as cards, each with a button to start from it. Attributes: title, button."
msgstr "Die Vorlagen dieser Website als Karten, jede mit einem Knopf, um damit zu beginnen. Attribute: title, button."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:899
msgid "Checklists recently opened on this device. Attribute: title."
msgstr "Auf diesem Gerät zuletzt geöffnete Checklisten. Attribut: title."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:902
msgid "Shortcodes"
msgstr "Shortcodes"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:922
msgid "Title of the checklist."
msgstr "Titel der Checkliste."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:923
msgid "Link to the checklist (contains its ID)."
msgstr "Link zur Checkliste (enthält ihre ID)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:924
msgid "The ID of the checklist."
msgstr "Die ID der Checkliste."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:925
msgid "The repetition in words, e.g. \"Weekly, 6 times\"."
msgstr "Die Wiederholung in Worten, z. B. „Wöchentlich, 6-mal“."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:926
msgid "The current round, e.g. \"Round 3 of 6\" (empty if the checklist does not repeat)."
msgstr "Der aktuelle Durchgang, z. B. „Durchgang 3 von 6“ (leer, wenn sich die Checkliste nicht wiederholt)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:927
msgid "First and last day of the current round."
msgstr "Erster und letzter Tag des aktuellen Durchgangs."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:928
#, php-format
msgid "E.g. \"Round 3 of 6: 4 of 10 done (40 %)\"."
msgstr "Z. B. „Durchgang 3 von 6: 4 von 10 erledigt (40 %)“."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:929
msgid "Progress of the current round as numbers."
msgstr "Fortschritt des aktuellen Durchgangs als Zahlen."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:930
msgid "Number of open entries."
msgstr "Anzahl offener Einträge."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:931
msgid "The open entries as a list."
msgstr "Die offenen Einträge als Liste."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:932
msgid "The whole checklist with the state of every entry."
msgstr "Die ganze Checkliste mit dem Stand jedes Eintrags."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:933
#, php-format
msgid "How the previous round went, e.g. \"Round 2: 8 of 10 done (80 %).\" (empty in the first round)."
msgstr "Wie der vorige Durchgang lief, z. B. „Durchgang 2: 8 von 10 erledigt (80 %).“ (im ersten Durchgang leer)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:934
msgid "What stayed open in the previous round."
msgstr "Was im vorigen Durchgang offen blieb."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:935
msgid "What is already ticked in advance for the next round, with a heading (empty when nothing is); {{ ahead_items_html }} is the list alone, {{ ahead_count }} its length."
msgstr "Was für den nächsten Durchgang schon vorab abgehakt ist, mit Überschrift (leer, wenn nichts); {{ ahead_items_html }} ist nur die Liste, {{ ahead_count }} ihre Länge."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:936
msgid "Unsubscribe link (the layout already shows one)."
msgstr "Abmeldelink (das Layout zeigt bereits einen)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:937
msgid "The site."
msgstr "Die Website."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:938
msgid "Only in confirm.html: the confirmation link and the hours until an unconfirmed subscription is deleted."
